thing anyways. This makes it so that if the script name is empty in ```plugin.cfg```, the checkbox isn't added. The editor itself does not allow you to _not_ define a script, but I'm not sure that the in-editor dialog is intended for advanced usage such as this.\r\n\r\nThis essentially allows any plugin to show information without confusing users with the checkbox. For example, the git plugin used to show information in the menu but it was removed because users were confused about the checkbox ([#267](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-git-plugin/issues/267)). With this pr the information could be added back and the issue would still be solved.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":307135532,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMDcxMzU1MzI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:plugin","name":"topic:plugin","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-09-24T21:32:29Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:35:40Z","closed_at":"2025-11-07T00:27:08Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"858b984d10f5b821ed5bc5802b9ff04242c316c2","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Kaleb-Reid:plugin-no-script","ref":"plugin-no-script","repo":{"id"